      "id": "DEC-TST-001",
      "statement": "In both root vitest.config.ts files, resolve setupFiles to an absolute path with fileURLToPath(new URL('./vitest.setup.ts', import.meta.url)). No per-workspace config files and no change to vitest.setup.ts content.",
